        "search_text": "The result of this grid drama was a glorious blackout spectacle, a significant power shortage that plunged the region into darkness. The precipitating cause was a comical slip of the machine: Kepco SPC Power's Unit 2 tripped offline, joining a boring saga of other long-running plant outages. This equipment failure, coupled with the heat's absurd timing, created a perfect storm of unavailability.",
